  "procedure": "新资产引用断言先失败；旧真实包增强缓存命中消费者在net472抛FileNotFoundException。修复后dotnet build AspectN.sln -c Release --no-restore -m:1 -nr:false -p:UseSharedCompilation=false零告警；dotnet test AspectN.sln -c Release --no-build --no-restore -m:1 -nr:false --logger trx，八TRX共2438通过。原verify-packages.ps1全流程生成五对新包并完成十消费者，两个宿主版本/依赖脚本共74项。实际包DLL/PDB配对与SourceLink检查通过，细节和哈希见数据。",
  "result": "passed",
